      "id": 1,
      "text": "Ceredo was named after Ceres, the Greek goddess of grain and harvest, because of the area's agricultural opportunities.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2",
