      ],
      "source": "https://wvexplorer.com/travel/communities/cities-towns/ceredo-west-virginia/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Abolitionist Eli Thayer founded Ceredo in 1857 to demonstrate the superiority of an economic system not based on slave labor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ceredo%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ceredo is situated along the Ohio River in Wayne County and is part of the Huntington-Ashland metropolitan area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ceredo%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
